# OJ Serial Execution

- Do not spawn subagents.
- Do not run multiple OJ test-engineering tasks concurrently.
- Run generators, validators, brute, reference, wrong solutions and benchmarks serially.
- Do not use background task fan-out or parallel execution helpers.
